Package: evolution-jmap
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         evolution-data-server (>= 3.52),
         evolution (>= 3.52)
Description: JMAP support for GNOME Evolution
 Backends that let Evolution and evolution-data-server speak JMAP
 (RFC 8620/8621): an address book backend, a calendar backend, a Camel
 mail provider, the collection backend that fans one account out into
 all three, and the account setup module.
 .
 The modules are dlopened by evolution-data-server and by Evolution
 itself, and must be used with the versions they were built against.
